      "writtenOn": "2024-11-15T20:49:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Not trusty specifically (we can have messages larger than 4096). I think its a limitation from the Android-Trusty communication path over virtio we currently have. At this point I am not sure of a header file that would be a good fit for this definition.",
      "parentUuid": "9a5b7a74_1338a1ca",
      "revId": "9e87b8758edb43eb2524a4e4e7cafe0b24b84b4d",
