      "message": "I don\u0027t like trusty_ipc.h for that because there is more than 1 of those files (for example there is one here in the binder repository for a mock implementation). I could potentially put the definition on `RpcTransportTipcTrusty.h`, because I see this more of a characteristic/limitation on this specific path (binder RPC connection to Trusty).",
